<!--
=====================================================================
S74 · MULTI-CAMERA STAIR ASCENT
8 s · 1920x1080 · 30 fps · first person + third person + face close-up + overview

PURPOSE
  Keep one animated Character 1 alive across four editorial camera angles.
  The first-person shot hides only the camera owner's head; third-person and
  close-up shots restore the complete actor without restarting its action.
=====================================================================
-->
